#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid "9.2 Tuning Guide"
msgstr "9.2 调优指南"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"The following parameters can be adjusted based on actual deployment "
"scenarios:"
msgstr "以下参数可根据实际部署场景进行调整："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"`--max-model-len`: Set based on maximum input/output length. Larger "
"values increase memory usage but support longer sequences."
msgstr ""
"`--max-model-len`: 根据最大输入/输出长度设置。较大的值会增加内存使用，但支持更长的序列。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"`--max-num-seqs`: Controls maximum concurrent sequences. Higher values "
"improve throughput but increase memory usage."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-seqs`: 控制最大并发序列数。较高的值可提高吞吐量，但会增加内存使用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens`: Controls the maximum number of tokens "
"processed in a single batch. Higher values improve throughput but "
"increase latency."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens`: 控制单个批次中处理的最大token数。较高的值可提高吞吐量，但会增加延迟。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization`: Controls the fraction of GPU memory used by "
"the model. Higher values allow larger batches but may cause OOM errors."
msgstr ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization`: 控制模型使用的GPU内存比例。较高的值允许更大的批次，但可能导致OOM错误。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"`--enable-eagle3`: Enables EAGLE3 speculative decoding for faster "
"inference. Recommended for most scenarios."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-eagle3`: 启用EAGLE3投机解码以加快推理速度。推荐用于大多数场景。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"`--enable-fused-mc2`: Enables fused MC2 kernel for better performance. "
"Recommended for most scenarios."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-fused-mc2`: 启用融合MC2内核以获得更好的性能。推荐用于大多数场景。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"`--enable-flashcomm1`: Enables FlashComm1 communication optimization. "
"Recommended for multi-node deployments."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-flashcomm1`: 启用FlashComm1通信优化。推荐用于多节点部署。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"`--enable-async-scheduling`: Enables asynchronous scheduling for better "
"overlap of computation and communication. Recommended for most scenarios."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-async-scheduling`: 启用异步调度以更好地重叠计算和通信。推荐用于大多数场景。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid "10 FAQ"
msgstr "10 FAQ"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"**Q1: The model fails to load with an error about missing weights or "
"incorrect architecture.**"
msgstr ""
"**Q1: 模型加载失败，提示缺少权重或架构不正确。**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"A1: Ensure you have downloaded the correct model weights from the "
"official MiniMax repository and that the `--model` path points to the "
"correct directory containing the `config.json` and model weights."
msgstr ""
"A1: 确保已从官方MiniMax仓库下载正确的模型权重，并且`--model`路径指向包含`config.json`和模型权重的正确目录。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"**Q2: The server starts but returns errors when processing requests.**"
msgstr ""
"**Q2: 服务器启动成功，但处理请求时返回错误。**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"A2: Check the server logs for specific error messages. Common issues "
"include:"
msgstr ""
"A2: 检查服务器日志中的具体错误信息。常见问题包括："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"- Out of memory (OOM): Reduce `--max-model-len`, `--max-num-seqs`, or "
"`--gpu-memory-utilization`."
msgstr ""
"- 内存不足（OOM）：减小`--max-model-len`、`--max-num-seqs`或`--gpu-memory-utilization`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"- Timeout errors: Increase `--timeout` or check network connectivity."
msgstr ""
"- 超时错误：增加`--timeout`或检查网络连接。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"- Invalid request format: Ensure the request follows the OpenAI API "
"format."
msgstr ""
"- 请求格式无效：确保请求遵循OpenAI API格式。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"**Q3: PD separation fails with Mooncake connection errors.**"
msgstr ""
"**Q3: PD分离失败，出现Mooncake连接错误。**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"A3: Refer to the [Public "
"FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html) for "
"common PD separation issues. Ensure network connectivity between nodes "
"and that the `nic_name` and `local_ip` are correctly configured."
msgstr ""
"A3: 请参考[公共FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)了解常见的PD分离问题。确保节点之间的网络连接正常，并且`nic_name`和`local_ip`配置正确。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"**Q4: The model output is garbled or contains repeated text.**"
msgstr ""
"**Q4: 模型输出乱码或包含重复文本。**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"A4: This may be due to incorrect tokenizer configuration. Ensure the "
"`--tokenizer` path points to the correct tokenizer files. Also check "
"that `--trust-remote-code` is set if required."
msgstr ""
"A4: 这可能是由于分词器配置不正确。确保`--tokenizer`路径指向正确的分词器文件。如果必要，还要检查是否设置了`--trust-remote-code`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"**Q5: Performance is lower than expected.**"
msgstr ""
"**Q5: 性能低于预期。**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:287
msgid ""
"A5: Review the performance tuning guide in Section 9.2. Ensure that "
"EAGLE3, FUSED_MC2, and async scheduling are enabled for optimal "
"performance. Also check that the batch size and model length settings "
"are appropriate for your workload."
msgstr ""
"A5: 请查看第9.2节的性能调优指南。确保已启用EAGLE3、FUSED_MC2和异步调度以获得最佳性能。同时检查批次大小和模型长度设置是否适合您的工作负载。"

