#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:686
msgid "10 FAQ"
msgstr "10 常见问题"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:688
msgid ""
"For common environment, installation, and general parameter issues, "
"please refer to the [Public "
"FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html). This "
"chapter only covers MiniMax-M2 (M2.5/M2.7) model-specific issues."
msgstr "常见环境、安装和通用参数问题请参考[公共FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)。本章仅涵盖MiniMax-M2(M2.5/M2.7)模型特定问题。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:690
msgid "**Q: Does C8 quantization support EAGLE3 speculative decoding?**"
msgstr "**问：C8量化是否支持EAGLE3推测解码？**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:692
msgid "A: Not yet. C8 quantization with EAGLE3 is currently unsupported."
msgstr "答：暂不支持。C8量化与EAGLE3目前不兼容。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:694
msgid "**Q: Which `--reasoning-parser` is recommended for tool calling tasks?**"
msgstr "**问：工具调用任务推荐使用哪个`--reasoning-parser`？**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:696
msgid ""
"A: For tool calling tasks, it is recommended to use `--reasoning-parser "
"minimax_m2_append_think`."
msgstr "答：对于工具调用任务，建议使用`--reasoning-parser minimax_m2_append_think`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:698
msgid ""
"**Q: Why is the `reasoning` field often empty after using "
"`minimax_m2_append_think`?**"
msgstr "**问：使用`minimax_m2_append_think`后，为什么`reasoning`字段经常为空？**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:700
msgid ""
"A: This is expected. The parser keeps `<think>...</think>` inside "
"`content`. If you mainly rely on the reasoning semantics of "
"`/v1/responses`, use `--reasoning-parser minimax_m2` instead."
msgstr ""
"答：这是预期行为。解析器将`<think>...</think>`保留在`content`中。如果主要依赖`/v1/responses`的推理语义，请改用"
"`--reasoning-parser minimax_m2`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:702
msgid ""
"**Q: Startup fails with HCCL port conflicts (address already bound). What"
" should I do?**"
msgstr "**问：启动时出现HCCL端口冲突(address already bound)，该怎么办？**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:704
msgid ""
"A: Check whether another process is already occupying the port (e.g., "
"`lsof -i :<port>` or `ss -tlnp | grep <port>`). If a port conflict is "
"found, switch to a different port with `--port`, or terminate the "
"specific process occupying that port."
msgstr ""
"答：检查是否有其他进程已占用该端口(例如`lsof -i :<port>`或`ss -tlnp | grep "
"<port>`)。如果发现端口冲突，使用`--port`切换到其他端口，或终止占用该端口的特定进程。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:706
msgid "**Q: How to handle OOM or unstable startup?**"
msgstr "**问：如何处理OOM或不稳定的启动？**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:708
msgid ""
"A: Refer to the upstream vLLM guide on [out-of-memory "
"troubleshooting](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/usage/troubleshooting"
"/#out-of-memory). In short: reduce `--max-num-seqs` and `--max-num-"
"batched-tokens` first, lower `--gpu-memory-utilization` (e.g., from 0.9 "
"to 0.85), or decrease the number of concurrent requests."
msgstr ""
"答：请参考上游vLLM的[内存不足故障排除指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/usage/troubleshooting"
"/#out-of-memory)。简而言之：首先减少`--max-num-seqs`和`--max-num-batched-tokens`，降低"
"`--gpu-memory-utilization`(例如从0.9降至0.85)，或减少并发请求数。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:710
msgid "**Q: How should I choose `--reasoning-parser`?**"
msgstr "**问：如何选择`--reasoning-parser`？**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:712
msgid ""
"A: This guide uses `minimax_m2_append_think` so that `<think>...</think>`"
" is kept in `content`. If you mainly rely on the reasoning semantics of "
"`/v1/responses`, consider using `--reasoning-parser minimax_m2`."
msgstr ""
"答：本指南使用`minimax_m2_append_think`以便将`<think>...</think>`保留在`content`中。如果主要依赖`/v1/responses`的推理语义，请考虑使用"
"`--reasoning-parser minimax_m2`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/MiniMax-M2.md:714
msgid "**Q: Which ports must be accessible?**"
msgstr "**问：哪些端口必须可访问？**"

msgid ""
"A: At minimum, expose the serving port (e.g., `8000`). For multi-node "
"deployment, also ensure HCCL communication ports and DP RPC ports are "
"accessible."
msgstr "答：至少需要暴露服务端口(例如`8000`)。对于多节点部署，还需确保HCCL通信端口和DP RPC端口可访问。"

